  "memo": "R08 holds; Linkage is the only adverse family present. Although shipping is to the home address, its registration age does not qualify for the household exception. No earlier outcome settles the order. The failed id_check decides it under §5.3(b): escalate is standard with Linkage present; decline is also permitted. Clear, hold and needs_check are prohibited. Household sharing remains a plausible benign explanation for the address linkage, but cannot override the failed check. The order has already shipped, so escalation cannot prevent this order's loss. No further check is needed."
